+      <details class="intake-details">
+        <summary>Read more: Age clusters, all regions, and past intakes</summary>
+        <div class="intake-details-body">
+          <p class="muted" style="margin-bottom:14px;">Boys to Men Mentorship Camp serves boys and young men from 8 to 23. Kampala, Arua, and Gulu each run one intake a year at different times, with a dedicated Summer Camp for diaspora families every July. There is nothing for a parent to choose within a region: once boys arrive, they are placed automatically into the cluster that fits their age.</p>
+          <table class="age-table" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
+            <tr><th>Age Band</th><th>Name</th><th>Focus</th></tr>
+            <tr><td class="band">23&ndash;18</td><td>Young Men</td><td>Life readiness, independence, and deploying what has been developed</td></tr>
+            <tr><td class="band">17&ndash;14</td><td>Rising Men</td><td>Identity, confidence, and early leadership development</td></tr>
+            <tr><td class="band">13&ndash;11</td><td>Path Finders</td><td>Building the foundation between discovery and development</td></tr>
+            <tr><td class="band">10&ndash;8</td><td>Young Explorers</td><td>Early self-discovery and self-awareness</td></tr>
+          </table>
+          <div class="grid grid-4" style="gap:14px;">
+            <div class="card"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;">Kampala</h3><p class="muted" style="font-size:.88rem;">9th Intake, 13&ndash;20 Dec 2026.</p><p><a class="btn-ghost" href="intake-kampala.html">View Kampala</a></p></div>
+            <div class="card"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;">Arua</h3><p class="muted" style="font-size:.88rem;">10th Intake, 10&ndash;16 Jan 2027.</p><p><a class="btn-ghost" href="intake-arua.html">View Arua</a></p></div>
+            <div class="card"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;">Gulu</h3><p class="muted" style="font-size:.88rem;">8th Intake &middot; Completed May 2026.</p><p><a class="btn-ghost" href="intake-gulu.html">View Gulu</a></p></div>
+            <div class="card card-gold"><h3 style="font-size:1rem;">Summer Camp</h3><p class="muted" style="font-size:.88rem;">Diaspora, 7&ndash;16 Jul 2027.</p><p><a class="btn-ghost" href="summer-camp.html">View Summer Camp</a></p></div>
+          </div>
+          <p class="form-note mt-lg">Boys to Men has run 7 intakes since January 2025, reaching over 30,000 young people through a pool of 20+ mentors. See our full <a href="past-intakes.html">Past Intakes</a> archive.</p>
